cifs: refresh root referrals

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Paulo Alcantara <pc@cjr.nz>
commit 8332858569a096cff02e157555d839e0be921ec7
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/83328585.failed

Also refresh cached root referrals so the other cached referrals may
have a better chance to have a working root server to issue the
referrals on.

